    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "P4V62r",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3100,
      "name": "836 notes",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 260,
      "content": "836 — Settings → Remote access (Phase 1). Spec: docs/features/836-web-remote-control.md, Desktop app.\n\nRow 1: Not connected · Waiting for approval · Connected · Reconnecting · Paused · Stopped, removed with its toast.\nRow 2: Disconnect confirmation · Connected in light · Stopped, every reason.\n\nLayout (Jason, 2026-10-18): one status card whose dot, sentence and actions change by state, then Access (switch, Disconnect).\nDisconnect is local first (Jason, 2026-10-18): no pending-removal state. If the service can't be reached, Not connected shows one line as its last error saying the computer is still listed on the account.\n\nNav: Remote access sits in the App group after Notifications (globe icon)."
    }
  ],
